{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/Planet_Explosion_2Gif.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the once-whole numen9 shattered, the oceans rose up to the sky, enveloping the world. The nine separate land masses are now exposed to the molten core of the world the \u201cinner sun&quot;. Intense radiation permeates crystal wastelands where monsters lurk, and where Rin D\u2019Lorah must venture in search of her missing father. Through nine episodes, you play as Rin \u2013 a hero with a special ability to restore balance to numen9, even if she doesn\u2019t know it yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/Choices_Gif_.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every choice you make shapes Rin\u2019s character and the outcomes of those you meet. Be wary of what you say, the people you meet along the way aren\u2019t afraid to talk back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/Objects_Exploring_Gif.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the fascinating world of numen9 from an isometric view. The truth of the planet\u2019s history and current crisis becomes clear as you discover hidden objects and explore ancient lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/Customization_gif_1.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you increase Rin\u2019s intelligence, humor, courage, compassion, and luck, you\u2019ll unlock unique customization suits that can be equipped to supercharge her character stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/VO1_gif_2.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/VO2_gif_3.gif?t=1746038476\" /><br><br>All nine episodes in the game are fully voiced by incredible talent. You\u2019ll hear familiar actors like Todd Haberkorn from Dragon Ball-Z, Damien Haas from Smosh, Joe Zieja from Genshin Impact, and gaming influencers like Storymodebae along with new voices you\u2019ll love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/ATLA_Gif_.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieving balance unlocks the game's true ending and leads to a special reward for a limited time: a five-episode animated series set in the same world called Sky of Tides: Atla, which you can watch right inside the game. <i>(45 min of total video content)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/Your_Choices_Matter_Gif.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">32 endings! Your choices throughout this adventure shape Rin's character and the fate of numen9. Outcomes in the game are tied to your ability to reach thresholds in each of the five character stats, and in a twist, balance (not min-max), leads to the true ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">                        </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1120330?t=1746038476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746038476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/fa4bdf5f5ce9911addf4f46d3d7f0ff4e7be149f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746038476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/fa4bdf5f5ce9911addf4f46d3d7f0ff4e7be149f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746038476","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1879900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Buzz</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/PressQuote_Gamereactor.png?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/Group_8407.png?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/PressQuote_NintendoWorld.png?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/Group_8405.png?t=1746038476\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/Planet_Explosion_2Gif.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the once-whole numen9 shattered, the oceans rose up to the sky, enveloping the world. The nine separate land masses are now exposed to the molten core of the world the \u201cinner sun&quot;. Intense radiation permeates crystal wastelands where monsters lurk, and where Rin D\u2019Lorah must venture in search of her missing father. Through nine episodes, you play as Rin \u2013 a hero with a special ability to restore balance to numen9, even if she doesn\u2019t know it yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/Choices_Gif_.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every choice you make shapes Rin\u2019s character and the outcomes of those you meet. Be wary of what you say, the people you meet along the way aren\u2019t afraid to talk back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/Objects_Exploring_Gif.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the fascinating world of numen9 from an isometric view. The truth of the planet\u2019s history and current crisis becomes clear as you discover hidden objects and explore ancient lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/Customization_gif_1.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you increase Rin\u2019s intelligence, humor, courage, compassion, and luck, you\u2019ll unlock unique customization suits that can be equipped to supercharge her character stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/VO1_gif_2.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/VO2_gif_3.gif?t=1746038476\" /><br><br>All nine episodes in the game are fully voiced by incredible talent. You\u2019ll hear familiar actors like Todd Haberkorn from Dragon Ball-Z, Damien Haas from Smosh, Joe Zieja from Genshin Impact, and gaming influencers like Storymodebae along with new voices you\u2019ll love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/ATLA_Gif_.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieving balance unlocks the game's true ending and leads to a special reward for a limited time: a five-episode animated series set in the same world called Sky of Tides: Atla, which you can watch right inside the game. <i>(45 min of total video content)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/Your_Choices_Matter_Gif.gif?t=1746038476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">32 endings! Your choices throughout this adventure shape Rin's character and the fate of numen9. Outcomes in the game are tied to your ability to reach thresholds in each of the five character stats, and in a twist, balance (not min-max), leads to the true ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">                        </p>","developers":["Lofty Sky Entertainment Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/ce320f58cee1697765b1e9f0a3b73aa7c291c215/header.jpg?t=1746038476","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92023 ESDigital Games UK Ltd. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n\u00a92020 Lofty Sky Entertainment Inc., a Lofty Sky Media Group company. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br